                  <nc xml:id="m-7f2b9725-75f1-479c-9e28-1c4186fba81f" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-18a06021-f541-4031-b80f-c8c39512e482" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-eb3cb5fa-c9bd-49ec-8330-fc6e730fcf79" facs="#m-c6fd2be1-1772-47e9-80a1-5ce230bad2dd" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-01d4f776-e35a-4949-92a9-b582b01d4857"><lg xml:id="m-362a16f2-fa30-4317-bd4a-b8f979ab4388"><l xml:id="m-2e1b9231-ecc0-4374-86b7-28abb763f30d" facs="#m-989035e4-fbbf-469c-afd8-9225450f44c4" label="ambiguous">October 18.</l><l xml:id="m-ecf49161-9180-4623-9c29-664fc67d9d3c" facs="#m-858125d3-e53d-4f99-97f8-1dc825209b90" label="ambiguous">1692</l><l xml:id="m-97994768-63c0-4114-aaf0-2b45d5dac94c" facs="#m-6e0337de-950b-42c8-ac01-e3fa575ee211" label="lyrics-like">vír¬</l><l xml:id="m-edd08d2c-344c-4f40-82d4-4260d18667f2" facs="#m-bb79cffd-508d-4e3c-8766-93a1c67f24a5" label="lyrics-like">vínum gérmi-nans</l><l xml:id="m-b1cd7e9a-1105-497b-a427-df1a2c28ffed" facs="#m-2c7ca399-dd2d-4b58-9783-b0bb4ff2821c" label="ambiguous">gi-nes?</l><l xml:id="m-6409ce8c-79a2-4572-bac4-e309ecfb86a2" facs="#m-80e21507-550c-41d4-9249-8844a2db4e2e" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-93a8cbcd-5898-4a6b-9532-2a5a9e62819c" facs="#m-b187a041-72d7-439f-9b95-92d01a71ac52" label="lyrics-like">HCcépta tibi sint, Dómine, plebis quo, de Corde Filii tui emísso,</l><l xml:id="m-b45320a9-555a-4e78-88fd-5c3f6c8d469b" facs="#m-809cdd6e-8e38-4ec0-b265-2db57c070835" label="lyrics-like">Il tuae múnera: et concéde; ut beáta Margarita Maria veheménter</l><l xml:id="m-c3cf951f-9645-4d5c-976b-fc3fbf63fd69" facs="#m-dc547807-34d0-4958-aa6f-e4496db96ebc" label="lyrics-like">ignis ille divínus nos inflámmet, laestuávit. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-ca4c61ab-914c-472e-9b0e-0b8a95a3921a" facs="#m-fe3e40e2-3885-4629-9cf6-54f625ca6aea" label="ambiguous">comm.8</l><l xml:id="m-6c347958-7b9b-4dcc-93cc-92814f72f43d" facs="#m-857678b5-b918-4099-878e-5cc7fa9f575e" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-a8c76cd4-b5c3-4ae7-97d0-ded8f971db9b" facs="#m-3e58d894-5433-40be-a2ce-f33ed88b82ac" label="lyrics-like">-go di-lé-cto mé¬ o“et di-léctus mé- us mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5c35396-4081-4808-9798-8625477e82c5" facs="#m-1e77ce46-ac13-4cab-8ed2-2e3d022456d6" label="lyrics-like">hi, qui pásci-tur inter lí-li¬ a.</l><l xml:id="m-d35bc9bb-299a-4f66-8b66-04b4d35ad22d" facs="#m-06795bde-34ee-4e9d-a45e-da1a1f4bede7" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-4415637c-f6a9-4ea4-8ea3-d7aaaadba3e6" facs="#m-7c370d27-fa0e-4aa3-b4ec-ba3cb9da12c5" label="lyrics-like">vOrporis et sánguinis tui, Dómine! ut, supérbis saéculi vanitátibus exú¬</l><l xml:id="m-81540e8c-dbfc-44a2-9e59-32c81e26cfc5" facs="#m-d907b268-e88a-4450-95eb-b0759dd3602d" label="lyrics-like">L Jesu, sumptis mystériis: con-l tis, mansuetúdinem et humilitátem</l><l xml:id="m-5b55fbb3-a0c1-4369-a616-4d2713e14232" facs="#m-1cb423fe-3085-4ff5-8a35-be8e40f0a8f6" label="lyrics-like">céde nobis, quaésumus, beáta Mar- Cordis tui induére mereámur : Qui</l><l xml:id="m-27fd1e99-aa36-4784-aa14-b606fc5d3bc8" facs="#m-9f5308c1-d3d6-4b92-a3d6-df8adf1b2e1f" label="lyrics-like">garita Maria Virgine intercedénte;! vivis.</l><l xml:id="m-29db01ae-56df-4dc7-aa78-25b4e827c608" facs="#m-d61b7ebb-6b52-4234-81df-0bdb8263357b" label="ambiguous">SAINT LUKE, EVANGELIST.</l><l xml:id="m-0b72ac8f-689f-4597-a058-c61a74c036e7" facs="#m-814c699f-e277-4552-8318-14cf36a24cd2" label="ambiguous">18.</l><l xml:id="m-f6b8234f-8bd8-4c25-ac21-c21b3b925d1b" facs="#m-01b81a07-ddad-4cec-b54a-f79d3feb70d1" label="text-like">Double of the Second Class.</l><l xml:id="m-f1bcb43e-f0b2-4dc0-93ae-89614ad82f4d" facs="#m-7e4a7d71-816d-4559-815d-fe82341374e2" label="text-like">At Vespers and at the Little Hours, all from the Common of Evan¬</l><l xml:id="m-15aeee55-c150-442b-9398-d75c217f7cc8" facs="#m-6118086e-4f67-4cce-9678-47534c9ec37a" label="lyrics-like">gelists, p. Illi. Prayer. Intervéniat. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-9144b3dd-5800-4ba1-ac41-0e4d71899ad7" facs="#m-7e74442f-dd7b-42aa-8529-a8a27fd71537" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-b3b4ba41-5312-485b-a1a6-57d79d0bf8a4" facs="#m-455a1552-0d45-49ef-b81b-d683fe4ac412" label="text-like">Introit. Mihi autem. p. 1304.</l><l xml:id="m-8eca85a4-218d-43bc-80dc-f46fb8bc04d1" facs="#m-17de8363-852e-4565-b2d3-d836f8bf6dd2" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-99a4dd01-79f5-4381-964b-9df4bfca8c84" facs="#m-89641408-2bc5-46bf-bbc7-78dbc7059a1c" label="lyrics-like">"Ntervéniat pro nobis, quaésumus! catiónem júgiter in suo córpore"</l><l xml:id="m-0832ada7-db0a-46b4-a52d-de3d46bffc10" facs="#m-1dbeb631-4491-4db5-8b72-8434ab904d27" label="lyrics-like">L Dómine, sanctus tuus Lucas</l><l xml:id="m-3c151953-0d82-4baa-ad4c-213de6fd6332" facs="#m-d70125a1-a750-424d-b210-495a9e47c665" label="lyrics-like">pro tui nóminis honóre portávit.</l><l xml:id="m-6819d20b-3505-4047-8a86-ad5391501728" facs="#m-e769e1ae-6216-4964-92e0-3578496d78c2" label="lyrics-like">Évangelista: t qui crucis mortifi-] Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-528120f5-66c6-4b6c-aef5-fe3e92490cf0" facs="#m-12360df1-61df-4571-9606-c00f71550d64" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. 2. Cor. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-8059eed9-caea-4d8c-a3dc-490c29b7c2e2" facs="#m-9f1ab98b-acaa-4c52-bb3d-26b2b5338e1a" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Grátias ago Deo, qui sias: non solum autem, sed et ordi¬</l><l xml:id="m-089a64bd-7d6c-4cc1-aa33-71641bcceebb" facs="#m-1ce56d15-aef2-4a93-8766-04afe308f619" label="lyrics-like">dedit eámdem sollicitúdinem</l><l xml:id="m-ef849bf1-9c1c-4362-9ddb-c656b9e94cd6" facs="#m-daff1453-5b91-4df1-a31a-59827e46f441" label="lyrics-like">nátus est ab ecclésiis comes pere¬</l><l xml:id="m-420d517d-7025-4651-8478-f87d6a169d16" facs="#m-368aae44-6d3b-4ab0-bbfb-8fe4c464842c" label="lyrics-like">grinatiónis nostrae, in hanc grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-95a4d001-1eb7-4d84-a99a-2583d9687eb5" facs="#m-9ca50240-ae2b-4b41-8e19-65d417f0617c" label="lyrics-like">pro vobis in corde Titi; quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-0e6fb52c-e6a2-4ce2-bbf1-9d266f7913ac" facs="#m-c30f11c4-afbe-4998-9593-56d297e21041" label="lyrics-like">exhortatiónem quidem suscépit:</l><l xml:id="m-0ae0facb-611f-4792-9bb7-3f0527586e66" facs="#m-76fce9e6-1a99-4a3c-9667-cb6a0603b312" label="lyrics-like">tiam quae ministrátur a nobis ad</l><l xml:id="m-59bb0f5d-a562-44d3-ad45-f6e7e9a4ca77" facs="#m-a9bfb9be-436b-4584-8cf3-c75a376dd28f" label="lyrics-like">Dómini glóriam, et destinátam vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-24ea7dd7-7a63-4800-9558-9cafe3348311" facs="#m-9a0e5964-e5a1-4011-8c33-6221ebc537a6" label="ambiguous">sed cum sollicitior esset, sua volun¬</l><l xml:id="m-732a8725-b06a-4231-b1cf-ec37157d5ef6" facs="#m-9ececb6e-2c1c-40d4-9edc-c805410e043b" label="lyrics-like">táte proféctus est ad vos. Mísimus</l><l xml:id="m-4753f47c-0013-41c1-a294-0e61788d1d09" facs="#m-bc7a4e33-1efb-47a9-a1f8-4ac65e8a4368" label="lyrics-like">luntátem nostram: devitántes hoc,</l><l xml:id="m-c4ddd1c9-8740-4036-9cc1-7f3bab9f8c18" facs="#m-eb55a752-73ce-4765-b7f4-5050e987a373" label="lyrics-like">étiam cum illo fratrem, cuius laus</l><l xml:id="m-7fd36edc-5d6f-484c-ad58-3c0b5298a3ba" facs="#m-7d30d2b3-1d76-4c82-8019-5baf0281ce98" label="lyrics-like">ne quis nos vitúperet in hac pleni¬</l><l xml:id="m-e9f85b25-fc91-4895-ab84-c86371d20d8a" facs="#m-51f8301e-4754-43b5-95f2-4361e9b528e4" label="lyrics-like">est in Evangélio per omnes ecclé-túdine, quae ministrátur a nobis.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
